rota lap 4196, row 1 -- Air, the row that feels: law and boundary, and its own test is to run a hand along an edge and press. Pressed three edges in this lane before finding the one that gave: the bounds reader's order relations hold, the cellar catalog holds, and the Door register ceiling that governs this lane's front door was never touching it.
think Opened with the cold roster scoped. Two reds, one root -- index_row_bound on a misordered shelf row, %440's eleventh shape, and standing_equipment reporting it. index_shelf_repair.sh sorted the shelf; both green.
think Pressed the lane's own fences first rather than reaching for prose. amphora_bounds_agree already declares its order relations both ways, vessel_fetch_wire asserts the resin roof against max_resin_chunks * max_chunk_body at comptime, and main reads its dock chunks by index rather than by listing, so the zero-padded name promises nothing it must keep.
think Three living tools name bron-resins/pond-supersede-exit.bron and the file has never existed. Read all three before booking anything: each asserts its ABSENCE -- the Pond season is closed and that resin is what an open one would leave. Resolution before accusation, %463.
think The edge that gave was the register. amphora/README.md read 29% negative over 41 sentences against Gauge's 20% Door ceiling, and prose_register_scan.sh never measured it -- its Door roster names twelve documents and discovers none, by a deliberate clause in its own head.
think Measured the population that clause leaves out before touching a word: 80 tracked front doors carry the scan's eight-sentence floor and 30 read over the ceiling. So a green door_over_ceiling=0 has always meant the doors that agreed are inside.
obs A room joins the enforced tier by paying its way in, and this lap paid it: six sentences restated to lead with what is, then the path added to the roster in the same commit. Sweeping without joining leaves the number free to drift back next lap; joining without sweeping reds the tree for work it never agreed to cover.
obs The first restatement changed a claim and the second reading caught it. `the first eight leave to their imports` contradicted the sentence after it, which says those eight DO reach manifest_entry.rye by import; the three unclocked modules are reached by nothing. `put three more modules on a clock` says what happened and costs no negation.
obs Every other sentence was held. The refusal-led lines in the witness paragraphs keep their words -- refusal is genuinely their subject, and six of 41 is inside the ceiling with room.
obs The blind spot is now printed in the scan's own head rather than left to be assumed, which is the habit the last three laps in this lane converged on: a guard that reports only what it gates reads as though it covered the room.
obs The card had six bytes of slack after the fold. The elder COPAL account shelved and the new block was written three times against `living_pin_max_bytes` until it fit.
