recommend keep-going -- the next agent-doable lap in this lane is the same question one room over: 30 front doors stand over the Door ceiling and each joins by its own lane's hand, so the honest next move is a shape a lane can follow rather than a sweep from here. Worth Keaton's word on whether the scan should PRINT that population every run, the way this lap wrote it into the head by hand.
